| `W_FREQUENCY` | {{raw:config.W_FREQUENCY}} | Weight of overall frequency |
| `W_RECENCY` | {{raw:config.W_RECENCY}} | Weight of recency |
| `W_POPULARITY` | {{raw:config.W_POPULARITY}} | City popularity: matters only for new users and ties |
| `RECENT_WINDOW` / `RECENT_DECAY` | {{raw:config.RECENT_WINDOW}} / {{raw:config.RECENT_DECAY}} | Recency looks at the last 20 visits, each step back worth 0.8× |
| `TIME_BUCKET_HOURS` | {{raw:config.TIME_BUCKET_HOURS}} | 8 buckets × weekday/weekend = 16 |
| `COLLAPSE_REPEATS` | {{raw:config.COLLAPSE_REPEATS}} | Back-to-back check-ins at the same venue count once |
| `EVAL_TEST_FRACTION` | {{raw:dataset.test_fraction}} | Share of check-ins replayed in evaluation |
| `SAMPLE_USERS` / `RANDOM_SEED` | 25 / 42 | Demo histories picked at import (users with 100–500 cleaned check-ins) |
| `TOP_K` / `MAX_K` | 3 / 10 | Shown in UI / API limit |
| `PASSWORD_MIN` | 8 | |
| `LOGIN_MAX_ATTEMPTS` / `LOGIN_WINDOW_MINUTES` | 5 / 15 | Rate limit |
| `SESSION_HOURS` | 12 | Session lifetime |
| `HOST` / `PORT` | 127.0.0.1 / 5000 | Bind address |
